==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|stunta|lang=goh}}. Cognate with {{nl}} {{term|stond||time|lang=nl}}, {{en}} {{term|stound||hour, while|lang=en}}. More at {{l|en|stound}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃtʊndə/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-Stunde.ogg|audio (Austria)}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|g=f|plural=Stunden}}

# [[hour]]
#: ''Der Film dauert drei '''Stunden'''.'' - The movie lasts three hours.
# [[lesson]]

